   ∧
    ∀ #j. (Comm_S_ySG( S, x ) @ #j) ⇒ ¬(#j < #i)))"
*/
by sorry

lemma agreementDwrtS [right]:
  all-traces
  "∀ D S data #i.
    (Commit( D, S, data ) @ #i) ⇒
    (∃ #j. (Running( S, D, data ) @ #j) ∧ (#j < #i))"
/*
guarded formula characterizing all counter-examples:
"∃ D S data #i.
  (Commit( D, S, data ) @ #i)
 ∧
  ∀ #j. (Running( S, D, data ) @ #j) ⇒ ¬(#j < #i)"
*/
by sorry

